---
// Two promises hidden inside the word consistency. Durations are illustrative.
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads avoid duplicate marker ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="unb-fig">
  <div class="unb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 292" role="img" aria-label="Timeliness failure is temporary: a stale read for a few seconds, then fresh data. Integrity failure is permanent: a balance charged $22 instead of $11 stays wrong until someone repairs it.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="unb-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Waiting heals one failure but not the other</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chờ đợi chữa được lỗi này nhưng không chữa được lỗi kia</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="56" width="200" height="56" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="clock" x={45} y={84} size={26} />
      <text x="144" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Timeliness</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tính kịp thời</tspan></text>
      <text x="144" y="97" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>a stale read</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đọc phải dữ liệu cũ</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="62" width="200" height="44" rx="4" class="unb-box is-dash" />
      <text x="350" y="88.5" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Stale for a few seconds</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cũ trong vài giây</tspan></text>
      <rect x="460" y="62" width="400" height="44" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <text x="660" y="88.5" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Fresh again: waiting fixed it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mới lại rồi: chờ là xong</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="146" width="200" height="56" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="shield" x={45} y={174} size={26} />
      <text x="144" y="170" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Integrity</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tính toàn vẹn</tspan></text>
      <text x="144" y="187" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>$22 instead of $11</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>$22 thay vì $11</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="152" width="610" height="44" rx="4" class="unb-box is-hot" />
      <text x="555" y="178.5" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>The balance stays wrong, however long you wait</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Số dư vẫn sai, chờ bao lâu cũng vậy</tspan></text>
      <text x="250" y="224" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>Nobody fixes it for you: someone has to write a repair job.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không ai tự sửa hộ: phải có người viết job sửa chữa.</tspan></text>
      <path d="M250,262 L853,262" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="852,257.5 852,266.5 860,262" class="unb-head" />
      <text x="20" y="266" text-anchor="start" class="unb-tick"><tspan data-lang-en>time</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thời gian</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A timeliness failure is temporary; an integrity failure is permanent. That is why integrity deserves the strict machinery.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Lỗi về tính kịp thời chỉ là tạm thời, còn lỗi về tính toàn vẹn là vĩnh viễn. Vì vậy tính toàn vẹn mới cần cơ chế chặt chẽ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .unb-fig { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .unb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .unb-fig svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .unb-fig text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .unb-fig .unb-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-mono { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .unb-fig .unb-tick { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-panel { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-fill { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-panel.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-good { fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-hot { fill: none; }
  .unb-solid { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-solid.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-dashedline { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-dashed { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .unb-dashed.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-dashed.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .unb-head.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-step { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-step.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .unb-step.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-fig .unb-step-n { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
